      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Mar adentro, Māui salió de golpe de debajo del piso.",
          "en": "Far out at sea, Māui popped up from under the floor."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus hermanos se enojaron. «Te vamos a llevar de vuelta a tierra», dijeron.",
          "en": "His brothers were angry. 'We are taking you back to land,' they said."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Māui recitó un karakia, un canto sagrado, y la costa se alejó, muy lejos.",
          "en": "But Māui chanted a karakia, a sacred chant, and the shore moved far, far away."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus hermanos miraron. La tierra ya era solo una línea fina sobre el mar.",
          "en": "His brothers stared. The land was now only a thin line on the sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ya estaban demasiado lejos para volver.",
          "en": "Now they were much too far away to go back."
        }
      ],
