        {
          "es": "Era un pez, más grande que nada que nadie hubiera visto jamás.",
          "en": "It was a fish, bigger than anything anyone had ever seen."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tan grande, que la canoa de los hermanos quedó encallada encima, como en tierra firme.",
          "en": "It was so big that the brothers' canoe was left stranded on top of it, as if on dry land."
        },
        {
          "es": "Era Te Ika-a-Māui: el pez de Māui.",
