      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Māui dijo: «Una pesca así necesita una ofrenda a los dioses».",
          "en": "Māui said, 'A catch like this needs an offering to the gods.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "«Voy a buscar a un tohunga, un sacerdote. Ustedes, esperen aquí.»",
          "en": "'I will go and find a tohunga, a priest. You wait here.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "«Mientras no estoy, no corten el pez, y no coman.»",
          "en": "'While I am gone, do not cut up the fish, and do not eat.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "Y Māui se fue.",
          "en": "And Māui left."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los hermanos asintieron. Pero tenían hambre, y el pez era enorme.",
          "en": "His brothers nodded. But they were hungry, and the fish was huge."
